        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Hey, young man, that Savran over there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "It's okay. Let them come closer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_020",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard",
        "text": "But Mister Emperor, you still have a performance later. If some kind of accident were to happen..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Accident?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "You mean an attempted shooting, assassination, kidnapping, suicide threat, or something along those lines?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Do you think those things can stop me? Me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "No, those things shall only become a part of my show, just like how rhythm breaks apart the meaning of words. Do you understand?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_020",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard",
        "text": "Well, no..."
